Dialogue: 2,0:23:06.70,0:23:13.45,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}冷めないで　邪魔しないから
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.45,0:23:17.79,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}わたし灰色景色
Dialogue: 2,0:23:17.79,0:23:24.13,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}なんで気になってるの？
Dialogue: 2,0:23:24.13,0:23:28.39,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}わたし良いとこないよ
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.39,0:23:33.29,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}好き…(すき…)嫌い…(きらい…)　わかんないけど
Dialogue: 2,0:23:33.52,0:23:38.65,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}心拍バグってる　君のせい
Dialogue: 2,0:23:38.65,0:23:45.36,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}普通の恋じゃなくても　綺麗じゃなくても
Dialogue: 2,0:23:45.36,0:23:49.82,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}自分らしく それでいいじゃん
Dialogue: 2,0:23:49.82,0:23:57.46,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}不器用でも届けたい想いがあるの
Dialogue: 2,0:23:57.46,0:24:00.97,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,520)\c&H502532&\t(10,1520,\c&H4E081C&)\t(1521,2140,\c&H651727&)\t(2141,3300,\c&H6C382A&)\t(3301,3960,\c&H4C2D2B&)\t(3961,4470,\c&H4F3939&)\t(4471,5530,\c&H6C382A&)\t(5531,6320,\c&H651727&)\t(6321,7100,\c&H4C2D2B&)}ナイショだけどホンキだよ
